                                "sense_id": "c24ac837-29d8-3042-9626-986138c791c3",
                                "text": "There will be silver coins of 5 and 2 zloty and nickel of 1 zloty and 50, 20 and 10 grosz, the divisions of the zloty. Bronze coins of 5, 2 and 1 grosz also will be issued."
                            }
                        ]
